{
 "elemod": 2,
 "id": "xtal",
 "version": "1.0",
 "title": "XTAL",
 "description": "XTAL for the Digitone mk1 (OS 1.44): a macro-only autopan + WRMZ guest pack. One master page, one right-edge depth bar. A toggles the macro, D cycles four modes (SLOW, TIGHT, WIDE, ECHO) with different WRMZ time/feedback and STEREO PAN speed/depth, B/C/E/F/G/H edit the depth. OFF: XTAL scrolls on a 4 px dot lattice with the depth bar visible. ON: three diamond outlines; at depth 0 they sit on one centre (one diamond), and separate L/R as depth rises. Mode changes scroll a small 4x5 title across the top dot rows. State is stored per pattern in one reserved MIDI track (CH 16, pattern+0x1BB0, magic ESO4). Requires core 4.0 and the ESOTERIKA page host; includes neither.",
 "category": "Sound",
 "author": "Digital Alchemy DSP",
 "license": "GPL-2.0-or-later",
 "target": {
  "device": "digitone-mk1",
  "product": "Digitone mk1",
  "os": "1.44",
